Usage:
  play-publisher upload <file> [flags]

Flags:
  -h, --help                     help for upload
  -s, --service-account string   the service account (required)
  -r, --skip-review              skip review (changesNotSentForReview)
  -S, --status string            status (completed, inProgress, draft, halted) (default "completed")
  -t, --track string             the track (default "internal")

required flag(s) "service-account" not set
